      <div type="clause" n="23.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 23.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Wealh gafolgelda CXX sciƚƚ, his sunu C, ðeowne LX, somhwelcne fiftegum; Weales hyd twelfum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A Welsh tax-payer [has a wergild of] 120 shillings, his son 100, a slave [a worth of] 60, some fifty. A Welshman [can redeem his] skin [from a beating with] twelve [shillings].</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">[The wergeld of] a Welsh taxpayer [is] 120 shillings; of his son 100 shillings. [The amount to be paid for killing] a slave [is normally] 60 [shillings] but in some cases 50 [shillings]. A Welshman may compound for a scourging by the payment of 12 shillings</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Wealh gafolgylda CXX scll', his sunu C, ðeowne LX, somhwylcne mid fiftig; Weales hyd mid twelfum.</ab>
      </div>
